<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Top" id="t00567">
	<title>Limitations of Driver Attention Warning</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>Driver Attention Warning may operate abnormally or unexpectedly under the following circumstances:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>You are driving aggressively.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>You frequently change lanes.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Other functions of the Driver Assistance system, such as Lane Keeping Assist, are controlling the vehicle.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>If lane markings are faint, worn, or otherwise difficult to detect.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<section>
			<title>Leading vehicle departure alert function</title>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>When a vehicle cuts in</p>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03623">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e03624">
											<image href="images/N_SP327_B10_039.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2">
										<fig id="e03625">
											<image href="images/N_SP327_B10_040.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table>
					<ol outputclass="callout">
						<li>
							<p>Your vehicle</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p>Vehicle ahead</p>
						</li>
					</ol>
					<p>If a vehicle cuts in ahead of you, Leading Departure Alert may not operate properly.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When the vehicle ahead sharply steers</p>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03626">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e03627">
											<image href="images/N_SP327_B10_046.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2">
										<ol outputclass="callout" id="e03628">
											<li>
												<p>Your vehicle</p>
											</li>
											<li>
												<p>Vehicle ahead</p>
											</li>
										</ol>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table>
					<p>If a vehicle ahead makes a sharp turn (to the left or right or a U-turn), Leading Vehicle Departure Alert may not operate properly.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When the vehicle ahead abruptly departs</p>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03629">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e03630">
											<image href="images/N_SP327_B10_041.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2">
										<ol outputclass="callout">
											<li>
												<p>Your vehicle</p>
											</li>
										</ol>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table>
					<p>If the vehicle ahead abruptly departs, Leading Vehicle Departure Alert may not operate properly.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When a pedestrian or cyclist is between you and the vehicle ahead</p>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03631">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e03632">
											<image href="images/N_SP3i25_B10_042_IR.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2"/>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table>
					<p>If there is a pedestrian or cyclist between you and the vehicle ahead, Leading Vehicle Departure Alert may not operate properly.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When in a parking lot</p>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03633">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e03634">
											<image href="images/N_SP327_B10_042.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2"/>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table>
					<p>If a vehicle parked ahead drives away from you, Leading Vehicle Departure Alert may alert you that the parked vehicle is driving away.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When driving at a tollgate or intersection</p>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03635">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e03636">
											<image href="images/N_SP3i25_B10_043_IR.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2"/>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table>
					<p>If you pass a tollgate or intersection with lots of vehicles, or if you drive where lanes merge or divide frequently, Leading Vehicle Departure Alert may not operate properly.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<note type="tip">
				<p>Driver Attention Warning may not activate until 15 seconds after you restart the vehicle or initialize the front view camera.</p>
			</note>
			<note type="tip">
				<p>For more information about the front view camera, refer to <xref href="t00445.dita#t00445"/>.</p>
			</note>
		</section>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00564.dita#t00564" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Driver Attention Warning malfunction and limitations</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>